## Todo Execution Rules

1. **Read entire list** before starting — one checkbox per `tasks.md` task; no range stubs
2. **Execute in dependency order** — ready later-phase todos may start as soon as deps are done
3. **Mark completion**: `- [ ]` → `- [x]`
4. **Document blockers** — never skip silently
5. **Do not stop after a phase** — checkpoint verifier, then continue; “complete” only when the whole list is closed
6. **Forced pause** — last line is `Reply continue` or `/sdd-implement [task-id]`

